## out-of-scope systems (alignment, arena, banned words, conquest war, fishing,
## sound, server, kill streak, ziggurat, class change, observer, chat macro,
## emoticons, letters, ...) and foreign-language copies. No reader loads them,
## and code that depended on them is disconnected. Kept on purpose:
## DescData_Korean, DialogData_Korean, NpcAttack, DateTimes_Korean, and
## ServerLimit (it selects the Korean-region rows of many tables, not an
